# RetroPaint

Dazzle is a tactile kids' paint app. Keep the chunky neo-brutalist UI, synthesized sounds, and skill levels.

- Boot onto a ready canvas. No login, accounts, or splash gate.
- Skill levels: 1 brush + bucket + five colors (giant targets); 2 shapes, eraser, stamps, textures; 3 pens, spray, symmetry, gradients, FX inks; 4 live ink, spiro chaos, filters, opacity.
- New tools declare a minimum level and stay hidden below it.
- Applicators (how paint lands) stay separate from inks (what paint is).
- Canvas logic lives in `src/` modules. Do not collapse the app back into one HTML file.

```ts
// ❌ one mega script in index.html
// ✅ src/draw.ts applies the active applicator + ink
```
